---
/**
 * About, as a short letter in the first person. Every sentence is a fact from
 * the CV or from what Tudor has said about his work; nothing is a feeling
 * attributed to him that he did not state.
 */
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../../assets/tudor.png';
---

<section class="letter frame" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="column" data-enter>
    <Image src={portrait} alt="Tudor-Andrei Ifrim" width={88} height={88} class="portrait" loading="lazy" />

    <h2 id="about-heading">How I got here</h2>

    <p>
      Before university I competed in robotics, and came away with three
      national awards and a top-half placing in an international competition.
    </p>

    <p>
      Now I study Economic Informatics in Bucharest. What I build tends to be a
      system with moving parts: a market of agents, an airline’s bookings, a
      shop that has to take an order and a payment. I like working out how they
      behave, then making something people can actually use.
    </p>

    <p>
      In 2025 I co-founded Aruna Coffee. I designed the brand, drew the shop in
      Illustrator before it existed, and directed its build from those drawings,
      with Supabase behind it. The business sells over 100 kg of coffee a month
      through it.
    </p>

    <p>
      This summer I worked at Soft Tehnica as a junior programmer, alongside
      senior developers, on AI work in Python. Since July I have led the UI/UX
      division of SiSC, the Cybernetics students’ union, where I set up how the
      division works and started rebuilding its websites.
    </p>

    <p class="sign">
      <span class="signature">Tudor-Andrei Ifrim</span>
      <span class="role">Software developer, Bucharest</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .letter {
    padding-block: var(--section-gap) 0;
  }

  .column {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    width: min(100%, 34rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .portrait {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-lead);
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .sign {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .signature {
    font-size: var(--step-lead);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .role {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--step-small);
  }
</style>
